// Hand-written Elemental Shaman slice.
//
// Spell and aura ids follow the live game where known, but every
// coefficient, duration, proc rate, and stat curve here is an UNCALIBRATED
// PLACEHOLDER until this file is regenerated from the SimulationCraft spell
// dump. Do not read balance conclusions from it.
//
// Stormkeeper, Stormbringer, and Farseer take their chances, durations,
// stacks, and percentages from the 12.0 spell dump. Their spell power
// coefficients keep their in-game ratio to Lightning Bolt (Tempest 3.88 to
// Bolt's 1.7) against this file's placeholder Bolt. Talent tree shapes are
// partial and point budgets unverified.
//
// The rest of the Elemental kit (Chain Lightning, Earthquake, Elemental
// Blast, Voltaic Blaze, Ascendance, the Elementals, and the 12.0 spec tree)
// takes its mechanics from SimC and its percentages from the 12.0 dump; its
// coefficients are the dump's scaled by this file's Bolt (1.15 / 1.7).
